AI Customer Support Triage System
📋 Overview
This workflow automates the process of receiving, analyzing, and routing customer support requests. It uses an AI-powered triage system to categorize support tickets, determine priority levels, analyze sentiment, and automatically route them to the appropriate department.

🎯 Purpose
The system receives customer support messages via a webhook, processes them through an AI analysis pipeline, and performs the following actions:

Validates incoming customer data

Analyzes messages using AI (via Groq LLM)

Categorizes support requests

Assigns priority levels

Detects sentiment

Routes to appropriate departments

Creates support tickets

Stores data in Google Sheets

Sends acknowledgment emails to customers

Alerts support team for urgent issues

🔧 Technology Stack
Platform: n8n (Workflow Automation)

AI Model: Groq (OpenAI GPT-Style Model)

Database: Google Sheets

Email Service: Gmail

Language: JavaScript (Code nodes)

