🔄 Workflow Steps
1. Webhook Receiver
Endpoint: customer-support-triage

Method: POST

Purpose: Receives customer support requests

2. Customer Input Validation
Type: Code Node

Validates:

Message is provided and not empty

Customer name (defaults to "Unknown Customer")

Customer email (optional)

Adds timestamp

3. AI Triage Analysis
Type: AI Agent (LangChain)

Model: Groq (OpenAI GPT-OSS 120B)

Temperature: 0

Functions:

Categorizes message (billing, technical, account, general, other)

Determines priority (low, medium, high, urgent)

Analyzes sentiment (positive, neutral, negative, frustrated)

Routes to department

Generates summary (max 25 words)

Creates suggested response

4. Parse AI Response
Type: Code Node

Purpose: Extracts and validates AI response

Fallback handling: Provides default values if parsing fails

5. Prepare Support Ticket
Type: Code Node

Creates: Comprehensive ticket structure

Generates: Unique ticket ID

Maps: Category to department

Adds: Routing notes

6. Store in Google Sheets
Type: Google Sheets

Operation: Append row

Stores: All ticket information

7. Send Customer Acknowledgment
Type: Gmail

Includes:

Ticket ID

Issue summary

Assigned department

Priority level

Suggested response

8. Urgent Priority Check
Type: IF Node

Condition: Priority equals "urgent"

Action: Triggers support alert

9. Send Urgent Support Alert
Type: Gmail

Purpose: Notifies support team of urgent issues

Includes: All ticket details for immediate action

